  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Institutional Strengthening of Andean Supreme Audit Institutions (SAIs)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To support Institutional Strenghtening of SAIs through the design and implementation of a training The grant objective is to support the institutional strengthening of the Andean Supreme Audit Institutions (SAIs) through the design and launch of a region-wide audit training program whereby the technical capacity of the andean SAIs staff will be strengthened with the knowledge and skills to improve the carrying out of their staff functions and responsibilities.  By improving their staff capabilities and professional competencies, the SAIs will be able to meet the International Organization of Supreme Audit Institutions (INTOSAI)&apos;s overall development objective of being an effective institution in exercising their mandate.</narrative>
  </description>
